            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "You are all alone in the dark dungeon. Bats will chase you, ghosts will try and trick you, monsters around every corner. Hazards include spikes, guillotines, poison gas and more. Have you got the brains and fast reflexes to escape all the 100 dungeons in this unique action puzzle game?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play: You solve each puzzle by moving the hero and rotating the room with keyboard arrow keys. If you get stuck in any room, just hit Esc. Collecting the golden keys opens up the teleport to the next room. Silver key opens the treasure chest. To finish the game you must collect all the gold coins.",
            "about_the_game": "You are all alone in the dark dungeon. Bats will chase you, ghosts will try and trick you, monsters around every corner. Hazards include spikes, guillotines, poison gas and more. Have you got the brains and fast reflexes to escape all the 100 dungeons in this unique action puzzle game?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play: You solve each puzzle by moving the hero and rotating the room with keyboard arrow keys. If you get stuck in any room, just hit Esc. Collecting the golden keys opens up the teleport to the next room. Silver key opens the treasure chest. To finish the game you must collect all the gold coins.",
            "short_description": "Guide the little viking hero through 100 levels of monsters, traps and danger in this puzzle game. All you have with you is your puzzle solving skills, agility and timing.",
